  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 543.11 Third Party Liability. All third party obligations shall be exhausted before medicaid may be billed, in accordance with 42 CFR 433.139\n\nSource. #9324, eff 11-21-08 (from He-W 543.10); ss by #12103, eff 2-9-17; ss by #14384, eff 9-20-25 (formerly He-W 543.12), EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
